# A real exported artifact staged into the Docker build context for
# `--build-arg EXPORT_DIR=data-derived` (Dockerfile's web-builder stage;
# docs/deploy.md, "The bootstrap, stated plainly"). Machine-generated by
# `concontexto export`, regenerated on demand, and never a source file.
data-derived/

# Throwaway `astro build --outDir` targets from
# test/export/unconfigured-build-fails.test.ts. Created inside `web/` because
# Astro finishes a build with a `rename` out of `.astro/.prerender`, which fails
# with EXDEV across filesystems; removed by the test itself, so these only
# appear if a run is killed mid-build.
.build-guard-out-*/

# The same throwaway shape from test/export/missing-slug-fails-build.test.ts:
# an `--outDir` target, plus the copy of test/fixtures/export it mutates (the
# fixture itself is never edited in place — the Playwright run and half this
# suite read it).
.missing-slug-out-*/
.missing-slug-artifact-*/
